Discord MCP Ultimate
====================

This project is a fork of PaSympa/discord-mcp, version 2.2.0.

  Original work: Copyright (c) 2026 Léandre Moreau
  Original repository: https://github.com/PaSympa/discord-mcp
  Original licence: MIT (reproduced verbatim in LICENSE)

The MIT licence of the original work is preserved unchanged, and the original
copyright notice above is retained as that licence requires.

Added in this fork:

  - 78 MCP tools beyond the original 99 (server settings, bot profile audit,
    Unicode name styling, a resumable server architect, AutoMod, emoji and
    sticker management, structure backup, diagnostics, message scheduling,
    reaction-role menus)
  - a long-running bot process (welcome, autoroles, levels, logging,
    moderation, tickets, giveaways, starboard, temporary voice channels,
    autoresponder, slash commands)
  - a test suite covering all of the above

See docs/CREDITS.md for the open-source projects studied while designing the
bot layer. No code was copied from any of them.
